   "w": 1584,
   "title": "Why not the last menstrual period?",
   "items": [
    "it assumes regular 28-day cycles, ovulation mid-cycle, correct recall, off the pill for months",
    "even with correct recall, ovulation to implantation varies by up to 11 days",
    "early ultrasound dating has cut inductions for post-term pregnancy"
   ],
